1
00:00:08,233 --> 00:00:08,766
Should I close the door?

2
00:00:09,733 --> 00:00:11,433
Leave it open. Let the breeze in.

3
00:00:12,133 --> 00:00:12,366
Okay.

4
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:17,000
Why are you backing away?

5
00:00:19,733 --> 00:00:23,066
Afraid you'd think I'm blocking it again.

6
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,633
Then don't stand by the door.

7
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:29,633
Come here. Look at me.

8
00:00:36,133 --> 00:00:37,900
Don't force yourself just to comfort me.

9
00:00:39,833 --> 00:00:40,766
Who says I'm forcing myself?

10
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,300
I asked you here just to be with you.

11
00:00:43,333 --> 00:00:43,933
I understand.

12
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:51,033
I want to kiss you. Can I?

13
00:00:55,266 --> 00:00:55,633
Yes.

14
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:05,133
Mm.

15
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,000
Do you want to keep going?

16
00:01:13,733 --> 00:01:14,666
I do. Just take it slow.
